Follow `AGENTS.md` in the repository root as the canonical specification:
- Never modify `core/` (frozen Creature #1 copy) or `LICENSE` (Cosmogonic License).
- Commit and push directly to `main` (Hard Rules R1-R2); no git hooks, branch protection, or blocking lint gates.
- Tag all audit findings with the 10 classes (`bug`, `error`, `issue`, `problem`, `concern`, `dilemma`, `conflict`, `gap`, `hole`, `blindspot`).
- Maintain zero `sorry`/forbidden axioms in `lean/GlitchlingProofs*.lean` and `lean/Solution.lean`.
- Never claim consciousness, sentience, AGI, physical quantum effects, or solved Mega-Atlas open problems (`0/1,900`).
